FerrionOS change to upstream RedoxFS (MIT license, kept), made against upstream commit 5ba45a6887374ab425326656a276bb3b62eba7dc after the existing recipe patches. Found by the deterministic simulation in sim/redoxfs (sim/redoxfs/run.sh replay FILE runs a replay).

A zero-length write at an offset past the end of a file grew the file and changed its modification time; POSIX says such a write changes nothing.

Replay (seed 40): create /h; write /h 655362 0 leaves size 655362 instead of 0. Without this patch 120 of 120 simulated seeds fail.
